                "part_index": null,
                "text": "The Legal Principle: \"Valid at the Time\"\nIn common-law countries (such as the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, and Australia), the standard legal principle is that a person is judged by the laws that were in place **at the time the act was committed**"
