              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2518,
                "end_index": 2717,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Under this doctrine, if a criminal law is amended to be more lenient\u2014or if a crime is decriminalized entirely\u2014the lighter penalty is retroactively applied to those who have already been convicted"
